From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 23:53:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2862/3799] soh: rename D_80ADD7BC -> sLaughSfxPos

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the fixed point NA_SE_EN_PO_LAUGH is played from during the introduction
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c
index 54aecbaf9..a4885c729 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Po_Sisters/z_en_po_sisters.c
@@ -188,7 +188,8 @@ static Vec3s sPostPositions[4] = {  // was D_80ADD7A4 [LLM:HIGH]
     { 1717, 515, -1340 },
 };
 
-static Vec3f D_80ADD7BC = { 120.0f, 250.0f, -1420.0f };
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_80ADD7BC: the fixed point NA_SE_EN_PO_LAUGH is played from during the introduction
+static Vec3f sLaughSfxPos = { 120.0f, 250.0f, -1420.0f };  // was D_80ADD7BC [LLM:HIGH]
 
 static Gfx* D_80ADD7C8[4] = {
     gPoeSistersMegBodyDL,
@@ -1164,7 +1165,7 @@ void EnPoSisters_TurnToPost(EnPoSisters* this, PlayState* play) {
         Math_StepToF(&this->actor.speedXZ, 5.0f, 0.2f);
     }
     if (this->unk_19A == -70 && this->unk_194 == 1) {
-        SoundSource_PlaySfxAtFixedWorldPos(play, &D_80ADD7BC, 40, NA_SE_EN_PO_LAUGH);
+        SoundSource_PlaySfxAtFixedWorldPos(play, &sLaughSfxPos, 40, NA_SE_EN_PO_LAUGH);  // was D_80ADD7BC [LLM:HIGH]
     }
     if (this->unk_19A < -120) {
         Actor_Kill(&this->actor);
